WEBVTT

00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:21.293
Tolerance: double-click the ⌀8 dimension to open its settings

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:33.293
Format ⌀%.0f h5; tick “Arbitrary tolerances”, upper 0, lower −0.006 (ISO 286: ⌀8 h5)

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:46.034
Notes: click “Insert Annotation”, and write one line per entry in the “Text” property

00:00:46.034 --> 00:00:58.034
Export: menu “File → Export PDF”, file name LS-201

00:01:14.319 --> 00:01:23.040
Send the PDF to the shop or a supplier; for another CAD system, export DXF with the toolbar's DXF button
